  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Colombia Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sustainable Colombia  Facility is a multi-donor trust fund s aimed at maximizing the environmental, economic and social dividends of peace in Colombia, primarily in territories affected by the armed conflict. The Facility&#x2019;s expected long-term impact is the improvement of the wellbeing and living conditions of targeted communities and the sustainability of their territories, and support to the implementation of UN COP21 NDCs for reduction of greenhouse gas emissions.</narrative>
  </description>
